From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kirill <sleeply4cat@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 22:04:35 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 09/23] arm64: dts: qcom: add SM6225 and CHUWI AuPad

SM6225 builds on sm6115.dtsi and overrides what differs on khaje: carve-outs,
TLMM, USB HS PHY, UFS, clock controllers, 7 nm DSI PHY, MDP and GPU OPP tables.
MDSS gains DISP_CC_MDSS_AHB_CLK: without it, register access after a power cycle
returns junk, and UBWC setup is silently skipped.

The AuPad gets UFS, USB gadget, display, backlight, touch, GPU and battery gauge.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015ya7egg5XM6dMvKwj1kAyq
---
